question:
What is the output of the following program referencing an abstract type?
```java
abstract class Vehicle {
    abstract String getFuel();
}
class ElectricCar extends Vehicle {
    @Override
    String getFuel() {
        return "Battery";
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Vehicle v = new ElectricCar();
        System.out.println(v.getFuel());
    }
}
```

