What is the output of the following template method pattern program?
```java
abstract class ProcessPipeline {
    final void run() {
        stepOne();
        stepTwo();
    }
    abstract void stepOne();
    void stepTwo() {
        System.out.print("DefaultStep ");
    }
}
class CustomPipeline extends ProcessPipeline {
    @Override
    void stepOne() {
        System.out.print("CustomOne ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        ProcessPipeline pipeline = new CustomPipeline();
        pipeline.run();
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following anonymous class instantiation program?
```java
abstract class Task {
    int factor = 5;
    abstract int calculate(int x);
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Task t = new Task() {
            @Override
            int calculate(int x) {
                return x * factor;
            }
        };
        System.out.println(t.calculate(4));
    }
}
```

